sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User / 用户
    participant W as Web / Web 客户端
    participant G as Go Gateway / Go 网关
    participant C as C++ Core / C++ 业务核心
    participant A as Python Agent / Python Agent
    participant M as Model Provider / 模型供应商
    U->>W: Submit message / 提交消息
    W->>G: Create run + Idempotency-Key / 创建运行 + 幂等键
    G->>C: Validate ownership; persist user message and run / 校验所有权；持久化用户消息与运行
    C-->>G: Authorized run_id / 已授权 run_id
    G->>A: Execute bounded run / 执行有界运行
    A->>M: Model request / 模型请求
    M-->>A: Incremental output / 增量输出
    A-->>G: Normalized events / 规范化事件
    G-->>W: SSE run.started / message.delta / SSE 运行开始 / 文本增量
    A-->>G: Agent terminal result / Agent 终态结果
    G->>C: Persist assistant result / 持久化 assistant 结果
    alt Persistence succeeds / 持久化成功
        C-->>G: Durable result / 已持久化结果
        G-->>W: run.completed / 运行完成
    else Persistence fails / 持久化失败
        C-->>G: Persistence error / 持久化错误
        G-->>W: run.failed / 运行失败
    end
    W-->>U: Render final state / 显示最终状态
